{"v":4,"catch":"總共有125種不同的策略模式!\n迷宮的盡頭等待著什麼樣的結局？","desc":"《RAIMAIS》是TAITO於1988年發售的動作遊戲。\n駕駛“ORGANIZER”穿越迷宮的不同階段，以營救您被俘的兄弟。\n結局將根據您獲得的物品以及您如何通過迷宮而改變，因此請嘗試不同的模式。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-11-18","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e18d6ea8ff8aed2ac2e049484bf41facc9a0a35e58b11aaeb49c49bdccfa4d6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff9e8526e26d603ee81243b0f97ef3f7d1d60b815a280a643fa6d5b93c11a636.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8c6c741af2bb2de6b1b84a1564b94f5eed534f9281125f63421196cd4f26eb1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/acf4a35a6bbd8e8c8271dd03978acd192deb4e63aaad51bb306a9cd198ca45fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/92473aa5c0f398000dd317a7fdd8be8247c2d966bacb837569a10019eb584578.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/523e6ca3d450f2c13f10ca81e3c864862b7be2bd935515f6711c2316fec54a91.jpg"],"titleId":"010091f015e12000","dlc":[]}